    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Unravel the Mystery of Xi-Portal</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/extras/66b65fef7d063e683de0de87047ec740.avif?t=1749486955\" width=606 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xi-Portal is a horror game where the player transfers to a new school and tries to make friends. And then things unexpectedly take a dark turn as the player has to uncover hidden secrets and face terrifying consequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple storylines and choices, making each playthrough unique. The player must navigate intricate puzzles and solve riddles to uncover the truth behind the enigmatic Xi-Portal, adding an extra layer of suspense and fear.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the player must understand that every decision has no return.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/extras/13d990ff56b2251261f3e9d21025c8a2.avif?t=1749486955\" width=606 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/extras/e1d57745d3df38c0766e20d3366f3cdf.avif?t=1749486955\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/extras/421d91da46451f8d058e8523199d7197.avif?t=1749486955\" data-has-big width=800 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/extras/0b841c28295b1f7bf8a6502c1cd806d7.avif?t=1749486955\" width=606 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre:</strong> Visual novel, Horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platform: Windows, Android.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engine:</strong>\u00a0Ren'Py</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Languages: </strong>English, Arabic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >61,000+ words</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nameable MC</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five characters are available. Maybe?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map feature: You can go anywhere you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reading time: 4 hours and 8 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated gameplay time: +8 hours for new players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 different endings (4 true endings\u00a0 | 1 good ending | 1 normal ending | 3 bad endings\u00a0 | 2 worst endings\u00a0)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Point of no return game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARNING:</strong>\u00a0This game contains flashing lights, scary images, loud sounds, and jumpscares; it's not recommended for people who suffer from any kind of phobia. (Especially those who have a weak heart.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can contact the developer via the email:\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"mailto:kakamigu@gmail.com\">kakamigu@gmail.com</a>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Unravel the Mystery of Xi-Portal</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/extras/66b65fef7d063e683de0de87047ec740.avif?t=1749486955\" width=606 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xi-Portal is a horror game where the player transfers to a new school and tries to make friends. And then things unexpectedly take a dark turn as the player has to uncover hidden secrets and face terrifying consequences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features multiple storylines and choices, making each playthrough unique. The player must navigate intricate puzzles and solve riddles to uncover the truth behind the enigmatic Xi-Portal, adding an extra layer of suspense and fear.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the player must understand that every decision has no return.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/extras/13d990ff56b2251261f3e9d21025c8a2.avif?t=1749486955\" width=606 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/extras/e1d57745d3df38c0766e20d3366f3cdf.avif?t=1749486955\" data-has-big width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/extras/421d91da46451f8d058e8523199d7197.avif?t=1749486955\" data-has-big width=800 height=470 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2967870/